{"seq":1,"slug":"athens-and-youth","title":"Athens And Youth","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/athens-and-youth","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-son-of-athens","title":"雅典之子","url":"/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/athens-and-youth/a-son-of-athens","wordCount":2347,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"from-soldier-to-philosopher","title":"从士兵到哲人","url":"/c/people/socrates/life-and-times/athens-and-youth/from-soldier-to-philosopher","wordCount":2085,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"本章追溯苏格拉底的出身、成长与思想转向。苏格拉底是雅典的平民之子，成长于雅典的黄金时代，亲历了这座民主城邦的繁荣与战争的阴影。从一名英勇的重装步兵，到对自然哲学失望、转而探究人生的哲人——本章呈现\"雅典之子\"苏格拉底的早年生命，以及他从士兵到哲人的伟大转向。\n"}